message: >-
  Please cite the selected composition and its constituent contributions,
  this project and the upstream manuscript. The selected checkpoint is PR626
  with PR543; consult certificates/selected-result.json for publication status.
  Project-level authorship identifies the maintainer, not sole authorship of
  the community result. See CONTRIBUTORS.md and the frozen source notices.
title: "A sharper exponent for integer multiplication"
authors:
