    Jonathan Capalbo (PR567/575), Chafik Boukhalfa (PR583/586 and other work),
    Dugongue (PR541/548/552 and other work), DreamingOfClouds (bit hosting and
    assembly), Rohan Arun (PR559 and other work), and the full predecessor
    lineage. CONTRIBUTORS.md records parallel and research contributions,
    including artuskg. Cite constituent PRs where their results are used;
    preserve their licenses and assistance disclosures.
